  "worked_solution": "We compute the differential using the formula:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}f(x,y,z) & =(\\frac{\u2202f}{\u2202x})\\,\\text{d}x+(\\frac{\u2202f}{\u2202y})\\,\\text{d}y+(\\frac{\u2202f}{\u2202z})\\,\\text{d}z \\\\  & =[{e}^{-y}]\\,\\text{d}x+[-x{e}^{-y}+{e}^{z}]\\,\\text{d}y+[y{e}^{z}]\\,\\text{d}z \\\\  & ={e}^{-y}\\,\\text{d}x+({e}^{z}-x{e}^{-y})\\,\\text{d}y+y{e}^{z}\\,\\text{d}z\\end{aligned}\n$$",
